
=============================
Roby-Gould bond index program
=============================

This is a command line program for obataining Roby-Gould
bond indices from a gaussian FChk file

For detailed help, run the command:

   run_rgbi -help

Basic usage:

run_rgbi <FChk-file>

If you publish any of the results from this program please
cite the following original scientific publications:

   M.D. Gould et al (2008) Theor. Chem. Acc. 199 p119-270
   K. Alhameedi et al (2018) Int. J. Quantum Chem. e25603
   M. Woinska et al (2016) Sci. Adv. 2 e1600192


